samba-powershell (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the SambaAD PowerShell module, with Get-ADUser,
    Get-ADComputer, Get-ADGroup and Get-ADObject, and its Python backend.
  * Install the module under /usr/share/samba-powershell/Modules and link it
    into the PowerShell all-users module path from postinst.

